#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look a company up in its country's register when you press for it, from its register number (France, Norway, Finland, Czechia, Poland) or its LEI (GLEIF), and choose which of the official name, address, state and activity to keep. One request per press, carrying the number and nothing else, to the register's own service, which so learns which company somebody here is looking at. Off until an administrator switches it on; switched off, nothing is asked and nothing already kept is touched."
msgstr "Cuardaigh cuideachta i gclár a tíre nuair a iarrann tú é, óna huimhir chláraithe (an Fhrainc, an Iorua, an Fhionlainn, an tSeicia, an Pholainn) nó óna LEI (GLEIF), agus roghnaigh cé acu den ainm oifigiúil, den seoladh, den staid agus den ghníomhaíocht a choinneofar. Iarratas amháin in aghaidh gach brú, ina bhfuil an uimhir agus faic eile, chuig seirbhís an chláir féin, a fhoghlaimíonn mar sin cén chuideachta a bhfuil duine éigin anseo ag féachaint uirthi. Múchta go gcuireann riarthóir ar siúl é; múchta, ní iarrtar aon rud agus ní bhaintear le haon rud atá coinnithe cheana."

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/adapters.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "National Court Register (KRS), Ministry of Justice of Poland"
msgstr "Clár Náisiúnta na gCúirteanna (KRS), Aireacht Dlí agus Cirt na Polainne"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Register lookup"
msgstr "Cuardach cláir"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which registers Register lookup can ask, one per country, and how each one's answer is read: the Annuaire des Entreprises (France), Enhetsregisteret (Norway), YTJ (Finland), ARES (Czechia), KRS (Poland) and GLEIF. Nothing here asks anything by itself."
msgstr "Na cláir ar féidir le Cuardach cláir ceist a chur orthu, ceann amháin in aghaidh na tíre, agus conas a léitear freagra gach ceann acu: an Annuaire des Entreprises (an Fhrainc), Enhetsregisteret (an Iorua), YTJ (an Fhionlainn), ARES (an tSeicia), KRS (an Pholainn) agus GLEIF. Ní iarrann aon rud anseo aon rud as a stuaim féin."
